  "releaseNotes": "# Changes since version 8.1.2:\n\n## Fixed\n- [Regression since v8.1.1] Loading a certain PDF into GcPdfDocument causes a stack overflow. (DOC-6922)\n\n## Added\n- Method GcPdfDocument.SetCustomProperty(): adds a custom property with a specified value to the current document. (DOC-6911)\n- Method GetCustomProperty(): gets the value of a custom property with a specified name. (DOC-6911)",
